  "review_conclusions": [
    "Exact SHA-256 and byte-length allowlist limits Dhaga sharing to two reviewed styles; head-only, attribute-free replacement preserves cascade position and CSS URL base; unexpected CSS stays inline.",
    "Existing actual decimal 1 GB publication gate, PNG/JPEG optimization, source descriptor validation and crawler policy remain intact. New assets are counted in projected and final delivery bytes.",
    "macOS file export uses existing strict clone-aware copier; source must be regular, destination must be absent, no silent full copy. Linux explicit independent-copy policy uses COPYFILE_EXCL and free-space reserve. Staged PDF streamed size/SHA check detects mismatched source bytes.",
    "ResponsiveImage preserves automatic variants when no explicit srcset is supplied; reviewed previews supply their actual widths and sizes. Explore deduplication retains complete credit identities; all independent previews explicitly opt into full-image containment.",
    "Article and collection templates show image credits, licence links and changes. Article full captions and corrected collection captions preserve qualified imagery. Explore credits preserve supplied source titles and captions.",
    "Catalogue includes every image with caption, source, licence, modifications and original-art links. Manuscript bodies and their citations are untouched. No assertion that a metadata regex alone proves image provenance; independent source/visual reviews are recorded separately."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No heavy build, full rendered suite, browser comparison, hosted CI, deployment or final delivery-budget measurement performed by this reviewer in this task. Root owns these final gates.",
    "Reviewed current image integration and packaging implementation, not unrelated shared register edits.",
    "Linux copy branch was statically reviewed but not executed on this macOS host.",
    "Source-image visual/licence review is scoped to the existing cross-review-a.json and group-a research records; no new all-27 visual review claimed."
  ],
